,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_6","text":"I've marked the locations here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_7","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_7","text":"He hands me a tablet displaying a map of the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_8","text":"... Right in the middle of downtown.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_9","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_9","text":"Five blue circles are marked in the heart of downtown, with a sixth on the outskirts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_10","text":"Yes, we immediately dispatched nearby personnel,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_11","text":"but they found no trace of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_12","text":"Incidentally, there was a slight discrepancy in the timing of the D-Waves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_13","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_13","text":"Andersen points to a spot on the outskirts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_14","text":"This one appeared a week ago, while the rest all appeared two days ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_15","text":"The first person was summoned a week ago... No wait, you said you only heard about it yesterday, so I guess that would make it eight days ago...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ClassicCafe","bgArt":"classiccafe","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["phantom","ce009_01_1","ce009_05_1","ce009_04","ce009_02","ce009_03","quency_e","miranda_c"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_16","text":"That's right. One other person was summoned here by the D-Waves,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_17","text":"and they arrived before you did.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_18","text":"So the Phantom Thief in this video is the person who got summoned?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_19","text":"Hmm... I'm not sure. If it isn't you guys, then we're basically back to square one with the investigation...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_20","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_20","text":"After listening quietly for a while, Yukiko speaks up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_21","text":"However...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_22","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_22","text":"Yukiko turns on the TV with the remote.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_23","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_23","text":"Just then, a news report about the recent cases of people falling unconscious comes on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_24","text":"According to what Leona-san told me...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_25","text":"These incidents started about a week ago. Don't you think that's around the same time that person was summoned?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_26","text":"Hmm... It also appears to be connected to the location where the monster was sighted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_27","text":"You mean those things that look like Shadows?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_28","text":"Yes. From what I observed of the enemy Mona-san's group was fighting, it appears to differ from the Shadows I'm familiar with.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_29","text":"Its form and overall presence are similar, but there's something different about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_30","text":"Yeah, I thought the same thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_31","text":"They smelled different too!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_32","text":"Commander,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_33","text":"have you ever seen anything like a Shadow in this world? I mean... something like that monster from before?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_34","text":"Not at all. We fight something called Raptures. They're a kind of mechanical life-form.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_35","text":"In that case...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_36","text":"This is the first time they've appeared in this world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_37","text":"If they started appearing around the same time as us Persona-users,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_38","text":"they might be connected to us somehow. We may be able to defeat them with our Personas.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_39","text":"I've been wondering...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_40","text":"What are these Shadows like in your world? I understand they're your enemies, but what exactly are they?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_41","text":"Hmm... This might be a little complicated...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_42","text":"Shadows are actually a lot like the Persona I use. They're another version of yourself, in a way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_43","text":"Teddie and I both had parts of ourselves we'd been unconsciously suppressing that turned into Shadows...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_44","text":"But instead of rejecting them, we accepted them, and they became Personas. They're a little different from the Shadow-like things in this world, though.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_45","text":"...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_46","text":"Looks like the Shadows we know are a little different from the ones Yukiko and the others know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_47","text":"Yeah. In our case, Shadows are the rulers of Palaces. They're beings born from the distorted desires of powerful individuals.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_05_s_48","text":"They're not exactly another version of a person, but there are some similarities.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_05_s_49","type